{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n82.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"148","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Halleluyah. Praise the Lord from the heavens, praise Him in the high places. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Praise Him, all His angels, "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n84.jpg","n":"27"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"praise Him, all His hosts. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Praise Him, O sun and moon, praise Him all stars of light. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Praise Him, O highest heavens, O water above the heavens. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Let them praise the Name of the Lord for He commanded and they were created. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He established them for ever, for eternity, He gave a decree that will not pass. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Praise the Lord from the earth, dragons and all the depths. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Fire and hail, snow and smoke, the whirlwind obeys His order, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"the mountains and all hills, fruit trees and all cedars, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"the wild beast and all cattle, reptiles and winged birds, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"earthly kings and all nations, princes and all earthly judges, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/12","n":"12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"youths as well as maidens, old men with young lads. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/13","n":"13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Let them praise the Name of the Lord for His Name alone is exalted. His majesty is above earth and heaven. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/14","n":"14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He has raised the condition of His people, there is fame for all His pious ones, for the children of Israel, the people near Him, Halleluyah. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
